Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 20:50:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] i18n: add Simplified Chinese (zh_Hans) translation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds po/zh_Hans/quickactions.po covering all _() strings in the
r11 tree — including the VLAN, Scripts, Failover and Wireless
Quick Edit tabs. Dynamic messages use %s placeholders; no \n
escapes inside msgstr (po2lmo does not decode them).

Generated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)

Co-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
